{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44679","headline":"和琳法师初春法集之作 · 慧净","name":"和琳法师初春法集之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鹫岭光前选，只园表昔恭。\n哲人崇踵武，弘道会羣龙。\n高座登莲叶，麈尾振霜松。\n尘飞扬雅梵，风度引疎钟。\n静言澄义海，发论上词锋。\n心虚道易合，迹广席难重。\n和风动淑气，丽日啓时雍。\n高才掞雅什，顾己滥朋从。\n因兹仰积善，灵华庶可逢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"慧净","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44679.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44679","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}